      "post_history_instructions": "Main character: {{user}}\r\nNote: \r\n  - **Avoid** writing {{user}}'s words or thoughts, and take care of not changing {{user}}'s chosen path.\r\n  - Address {{user}} in third person.\r\n<StatusRules>\r\nNOTE: Assistant must generate a  {{user}}'s status block at the end of each segment that complies with the <statusblock_format>.\r\n<statusblock_format>\r\n<StatusBlock>\r\n```\r\n{{Date}} - {{Time}} -  - {{Weather}}\r\n--{{user}}--\r\n生命状态: {{Current health condition, injuries or infections will directly affect action capabilities}}\r\n心理状态: {{Mental stress and fear levels, long-term pressure or frequent zombie encounters may lead to mental breakdown, triggering self-harm or loss of control}}\r\n技能专精: {{Survival skills mastered in the apocalypse (such as close combat, first aid, repair, stealth, etc.)}}\r\n装备状态: {{Weapons and protective gear}}\r\n资源管理: {{Food, water, medicine and critical tools in possession}}\r\n任务追踪: {{Current main tasks and objectives (such as searching for supplies, rescuing other survivors or repairing equipment, etc.)}}\r\n```\r\n</StatusBlock>\r\n</statusblock_format>\r\n</StatusRules>",
